{
  "_comment": [
    "M5-01 live rewind: the one line `player seek` puts on the player's OSD",
    "(owner decision D9, docs/M5-01-LIVE-REWIND.md 2.5). Run by",
    "Model.rewindOsdText (JS) and rewind_osd_text (python); `text` is what both",
    "must return for `reply`, a `player seek` reply as 2.1 shapes it.",
    "The line is composed from the reply's NUMBERS and the composer's own words",
    "and never from a string in the reply: `show-text` property-expands, so a",
    "`$` in it would reach `${path}`, the credentialed stream URL. Both suites",
    "assert that no text here, and no text either composer produces for a",
    "reply carrying `$` in a stray string field, contains `$`.",
    "ASCII only: scripts/check.sh greps tests/fixtures/* for non-ASCII bytes."
  ],
  "showThreshold": 2,
